#: src/Form/AdnoFieldset.php
msgid "Adno project URL"
msgstr "URL du projet Adno"

#: src/Form/AdnoFieldset.php
msgid ""
"The address of your Adno instance. By default, this uses the static Adno "
"archive bundled with this module (no dependency on the official w.adno.app "
"server)."
msgstr ""
"L'adresse de votre instance Adno. Par défaut, cette option utilise l'archive "
"Adno statique fournie avec ce module (sans dépendance vis-à-vis du serveur "
"officiel w.adno.app)."

#: src/Form/AdnoFieldset.php
msgid "It is also possible to provide the URL of an image"
msgstr "Il est aussi possible de fournir l'URL d'une image"

#: src/Form/AdnoFieldset.php
msgid "Width"
msgstr "Largeur"

#: src/Form/AdnoFieldset.php
msgid ""
"The width of the container in percentage (e.g., 100%) or in pixels (e.g., "
"600)."
msgstr ""
"La largeur du conteneur en pourcentage (ex. 100%) ou en pixels (ex. 600)."

#: src/Form/AdnoFieldset.php
msgid "Height"
msgstr "Hauteur"

#: src/Form/AdnoFieldset.php
msgid ""
"The height of the container in percentage (e.g., 100%) or in pixels (e.g., "
"600)."
msgstr ""
"La hauteur du conteneur en pourcentage (ex. 100%) ou en pixels (ex. 600)."

